---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: Contact Neil Kodner about hockey assignments and editorial work.
permalink: /contact/
bodyClass: page-contact
---
<div class="wrap grid contact">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <div class="contact-body">
    <p class="contact-mail"><a class="big-mail" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
    <p><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="{{ site.email }}">Copy address</button></p>
    <p class="contact-note">For an assignment, include the date, the venue and your deadline. I’m based in Los Gatos, California, on Pacific time.</p>
    <ul class="contact-links">
      {%- if site.instagram %}<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/{{ site.instagram }}/">Instagram</a></li>{% endif %}
      <li><a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
